","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"machine has stayed at the state all the time. A transition in between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends the waiting at once, and the event is not processed at all. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition leading back to the same state counts as leaving it, so an","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"event of activity at a state, like a coin inserted, starts it over,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the timeout is asked for again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["\/\/ Give up connecting after ten seconds.","Task {","    try await connection.process(.timeout, after: .seconds(10), ifStillAt: .connecting)","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The event is processed like any other event when the time has passed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and can be rejected like any other event.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancelling the task waiting cancels the timeout, and nothing is processed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"CancellationError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if the task is cancelled while waiting."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Process an event after some time, if the state machine is still at a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state by then, like a timeout of a state.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/process(_:after:ifStillAt:clock:)"},